# devices/a72q/drivers/input/conf: the A72's own input drivers (docs/drivers-config.md).

driver STMFTS
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.stmfts.c
	help    the Galaxy A72's touch screen: an STMicro FTS5CU56A on I2C (QUP wrap 1 engine 1, address 0x49),
	help    polled (touchscreen=1): turns on its clocks, pins and supplies (LDO10A, LDO7C through RPMh) itself.
